      <h1>How to Automate WhatsApp for Small Business: AI Chatbots & Workflows (2026)</h1>
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>By <a href="/about" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;">Nazim · Social Ninja's</a></span><span>·</span><span>Published September 2026</span><span>·</span><span>7 min read</span>
      </div>
      <p class="article-intro">Small businesses lose up to 40% of inbound leads simply because they cannot reply fast enough outside business hours. By pairing your WhatsApp click-to-chat link with smart AI automation, you can qualify leads, answer FAQs, and book appointments 24/7 without typing a single message manually.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
